  {"heading":"KPI Tables / KPI Tabloları","segment_index":"S18.P7","kind":"untrue","en_span":"chapters/contact_tracing.qmd:523-523","tr_span":"chapters/contact_tracing.tr.qmd:516-516","proposition":"The English says the footnote shows the \"as of\" date (the date the data are current to); the Turkish says the footnote shows the \"baslangic\" (start/beginning) date, which the adjacent chunk contradicts because it prints str_glue(\"Data are current to {format(report_date, '%b %d %Y')}\").","reader_consequence":"A Turkish reader reads the table footnote as the start date of the data period rather than the cut-off date, so they misdate the reported KPI figures by treating 10 June 2020 as the beginning instead of the end of the data window.","confidence":"medium"},
  {"heading":"Import data / Verileri ice aktarma","segment_index":"S4.P1","kind":"code_mismatch","en_span":"chapters/contact_tracing.qmd:71-71","tr_span":"chapters/contact_tracing.tr.qmd:71-71","proposition":"The English names the R function here() from the here package as the tool that specifies the file path; the Turkish names a function burada(), which exists in no package and appears in no code chunk on either side, while the neighbouring function names import() and select() are left untranslated.","reader_consequence":"A Turkish reader looking for the path helper searches for burada(), finds nothing, and cannot connect the sentence to the here package that the load-packages chunk installs at line 27.","confidence":"medium"}
